+
+---
+
+#### [Chandra](https://github.com/datalab-to/chandra)
+> **Description:** Chandra is one of the more interesting document-intelligence repos for law-adjacent workloads because its repo summary targets complex tables, forms, handwriting, and full-layout OCR. That makes it relevant for intake packets, handwritten notes, legacy scanned exhibits, or administrative records where cleaner PDF text extraction is not enough. It is less famous than Marker, but it covers pain points many law firms actually hit. GitHub shows **4,395 stars**, **Python** as the primary language, an **Apache-2.0** license, and a **last commit date of January 13, 2026**.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/datalab-to/chandra](https://github.com/datalab-to/chandra)
