+> **Description:** WhisperX extends the basic Whisper workflow in ways that are especially relevant to legal review. Its README highlights word-level timestamps, speaker diarization through pyannote, VAD preprocessing, and high-speed batched inference. Those features make it far more usable for transcript review, clip referencing, and producing timestamped evidence logs than a plain transcript dump. GitHub shows **19,200 stars**, **Python** as the primary language, a **BSD-2-Clause** license, and a **last commit date of October 21, 2025**.
