+#### [ContraxSuite](https://github.com/LexPredict/lexpredict-contraxsuite)
+> **Description:** ContraxSuite’s README presents it as LexPredict’s open source legal document analysis software package. The repository structure links the web application to LexNLP, legal dictionaries, sample agreements, and deployment tooling, which makes it more of a contract analysis platform than a narrow library. It is older and not as active as the mainstream RAG stacks, but it remains one of the clearest GitHub-native contract review projects built for legal workflows. GitHub lists **176 stars**, **C#** as the primary language, an **AGPL-3.0** license, and a **last commit date of February 16, 2023**.
