+### Document Parsing, OCR, and PDF Extraction
+
+#### [Unstructured](https://github.com/Unstructured-IO/unstructured)
+> **Description:** Unstructured’s README frames the project as an open source ETL layer for turning complex documents into clean, structured formats for language models. That is exactly the bottleneck many law firms hit before retrieval or summarization even starts. The project focuses on partitioning, cleaning, and chunking more than 25 document types, which makes it particularly strong for discovery sets, deal rooms, policy binders, and mixed-format matter files. GitHub shows **13,532 stars**, **HTML** as the primary language, an **Apache-2.0** license, and a **last commit date of December 30, 2025**.
