+### Transcription and Speaker-Aware Audio Workflows
+
+`Gap note:` this category is still thin for lawyer-specific open source repositories. I verified only four strong public GitHub projects that clearly fit deposition, interview, or call-transcription workflows.
+
+#### [faster-whisper](https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper)
+> **Description:** faster-whisper is a reimplementation of Whisper using CTranslate2, and its README makes the value proposition explicit: materially faster transcription with lower memory use while keeping similar accuracy. That matters for legal teams transcribing interviews, witness prep, meetings, and long-form audio at scale. It is a practical backend choice when privacy and batch throughput matter more than a hosted transcription API. GitHub shows **19,260 stars**, **Python** as the primary language, an **MIT** license, and a **last commit date of November 19, 2025**.
